  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/04/IMG_0544.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(112 fotos) El campeonato de la Comunitat Valenciana de &lsquo;Street Workout&rsquo; ha sirvido este s&aacute;bado por la tarde para inaugurar la remodelaci&oacute;n de parte del parque 8 de Marzo en Onda, que incluye el mayor gimnasio al aire libre de Europa. La Fiesta del Jam&oacute;n en Caf&eacute; Colonial, ha sido el mejor complemento.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firapernilcolonialstreetworkoutonda/img_0411.jpg\" alt=\"img_0411\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firapernilcolonialstreetworkoutonda/img_0412.jpg\" alt=\"img_0412\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firapernilcolonialstreetworkoutonda/img_0415.jpg\" alt=\"img_0415\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firapernilcolonialstreetworkoutonda/img_0416.jpg\" alt=\"img_0416\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firapernilcolonialstreetworkoutonda/img_0417.jpg\" alt=\"img_0417\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firapernilcolonialstreetworkoutonda/img_0419.jpg\" alt=\"img_0419\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firapernilcolonialstreetworkoutonda/img_0421.jpg\" alt=\"img_0421\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firapernilcolonialstreetworkoutonda/img_0423.jpg\" alt=\"img_0423\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4